Saphira base group
===================

Installing this package installs a working Saphira base system:
ABI marker, filesystem layout, C library, shell, account management
and package tooling.

This package carries no payload of its own beyond this file. The
authoritative member list is the `depends` field of this package's
APK metadata (`apk info -a saphira-base`). Profiles and image
definitions must name the group, never re-enumerate its closure.

Deliberately kernel-agnostic and init-neutral: the image profile
owns the kernel and init-system choice.
